# GC-PREC-02 — Zn(OH)₂(am) precipitation ở pH 8, 8.5, 9
# Verify: WT-CHEM-Ksp-Zn (logKsp = -15,506 cho Zn(OH)₂(am))
# Phản ứng: Zn(OH)₂(s) + 2H⁺ ⇌ Zn²⁺ + 2H₂O ; log_k = 12,474 (minteq.v4.dat)
#   → logKsp (Zn²⁺ + 2OH⁻ ⇌ Zn(OH)₂(s)) = 12,474 − 2 × 13,990 = -15,506
#   → [Zn²⁺]_sat = 10^(-15,506) / [OH⁻]² ; tại pH 8: [Zn²⁺]_sat ≈ 10^-9,5 ≈ 3,2e-10 M ≈ 0,021 mg/L
# Input: Zn 5 mg/L = 0,0765 mmol/kgw (0,5 lần Cột A) — sẽ kết tủa hết → filtrate = [Zn²⁺]_sat
# Path: chạy từ D:\VECLab\tools\research\phreeqc-pin\3.8.6-17100\

SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -high_precision true
    -file actual/GC-PREC-02.select.out
    -reset false
    -totals Zn
    -molalities Zn+2 ZnOH+ Zn(OH)2 Zn(OH)3- Zn(OH)4-2
    -pH true
    -si Zn(OH)2(am)
END

# Sim 1: pH 8
SOLUTION 1
    -temp 25
    pH 8
    Zn 0.0765
END
USE solution 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Zn(OH)2(am) 0 0
END

# Sim 2: pH 8.5
SOLUTION 2
    -temp 25
    pH 8.5
    Zn 0.0765
END
USE solution 2
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 2
    Zn(OH)2(am) 0 0
END

# Sim 3: pH 9
SOLUTION 3
    -temp 25
    pH 9
    Zn 0.0765
END
USE solution 3
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 3
    Zn(OH)2(am) 0 0
END